{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":7,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":403,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1912785,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":277246,"Name":"RoxRoy2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1460383765,"LastPoster":{"Id":286871,"Name":"sashloz","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286871.jpg?_r=1462360488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":34,"Preview":{"Id":1912785,"PostDate":1460383765,"PostContent":"Hey everyone, I'm in need of some advise. \u00a0 My wedding is not until April 2017 but I already have...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"roxinegrant@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.231.176.83","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395269678,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RoxRoy2015","Id":277246,"Name":"RoxRoy2015","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.225.33.165","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80035,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ce35e9cbc293eee71d34b35307dc05e0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey everyone, I&#039;m in need of some advise.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My wedding is not until April 2017 but I already have my venue booked...therefore I have the location, date and time. The dinner is buffet style, so there are no menu options to pick from. I&#039;m just wondering, if I have all of this info, should I just do the invite and call it a day? Is it too soon to send the invite? I&#039;d just like to avoid extra money on another item (STDs) if I don;t have to.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks so much for the feedback!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912785,"PostDate":1460383765,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey everyone, I'm in need of some advise.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My wedding is not until April 2017 but I already have my venue booked...therefore I have the location, date and time. The dinner is buffet style, so there are no menu options to pick from. I'm just wondering, if I have all of this info, should I just do the invite and call it a day? Is it too soon to send the invite? I'd just like to avoid extra money on another item (STDs) if I don;t have to.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks so much for the feedback!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"roxinegrant@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.231.176.83","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395269678,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RoxRoy2015","Id":277246,"Name":"RoxRoy2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.61.107.139","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80035,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"341e41a65a47bf4a5256a616ffec8d3b","RawContent":"Electronic save the dates may be a good option for you. I used greenvelope.com and it was really reasonable. They have cute design choices and we were able to add our logo and even a song.","Attachments":[],"Id":1912794,"PostDate":1460406410,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Electronic save the dates may be a good option for you. I used greenvelope.com and it was really reasonable. They have cute design choices and we were able to add our logo and even a song. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cadesha.benson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.61.107.139","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1453547902,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286018.jpg?_r=1459635518","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Endreece","Id":286018,"Name":"Endreece","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.54.142.13","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80035,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0d74ebd32dea7f1d9b2cbfcbfb62ee20","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"RoxRoy2015\"] I would skip save the dates, that&#039;s what I did. We had all of our info within a month of being engaged. Since our deposit deadline was pretty soon after we booked we just sent out electronic invites through paperless post and to be honest I think our guest appreciated the early notice and all the info.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912795,"PostDate":1460408685,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277246\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277246-roxroy2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">RoxRoy2015<\/span><\/a> I would skip save the dates, that's what I did. We had all of our info within a month of being engaged. Since our deposit deadline was pretty soon after we booked we just sent out electronic invites through paperless post and to be honest I think our guest appreciated the early notice and all the info.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div>\n<div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10730;0\/st\/20160109\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/9fa9\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div>\n<div><\/a><\/div>\n","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1415533111,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1455040720","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.12.123.63","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80035,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b96917e6258ff494ec6d27b6e466c762","RawContent":"Perfect! That&#039;s for the advise. I&#039;ll look into greenenvelop.com","Attachments":[],"Id":1912798,"PostDate":1460409613,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Perfect! That's for the advise. I'll look into greenenvelop.com\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"roxinegrant@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.231.176.83","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395269678,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RoxRoy2015","Id":277246,"Name":"RoxRoy2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.32.119","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80035,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6e4901d3ecadacd6441c0fa17ebab69b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"RoxRoy2015\"] This is what I love about destination weddings, there simply no traditions required. you definitely do not need the Save the date! go ahead and avoid the costs and go straight to invitations, just like the other ladies suggested.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912800,"PostDate":1460413867,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277246\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277246-roxroy2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">RoxRoy2015<\/span><\/a> This is what I love about destination weddings, there simply no traditions required. you definitely do not need the Save the date! go ahead and avoid the costs and go straight to invitations, just like the other ladies suggested.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326839987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.12.123.63","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80035,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4503f4c4f307545a38e936786ef9c909","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks again everyone. I was able to find a save the date on g&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;reenenvelop.com&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;that matched my website perfectly and how cool that you can link right to the site!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912812,"PostDate":1460466981,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks again everyone. I was able to find a save the date on g<span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">reenenvelop.com<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0that matched my website perfectly and how cool that you can link right to the site!<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"roxinegrant@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.231.176.83","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1395269678,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"RoxRoy2015","Id":277246,"Name":"RoxRoy2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.192.76.178","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80035,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7a8ca33ab77668c4e315c8f1361afece","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am considering doing a Save the Date\/wedding invite all together with loads of information. We plan on keeping to wedding pretty small so sending out Save the Dates and having everyone book their hotel and flights early and then sending out formal invites a few months prior to the wedding just doesn&#039;t make sense to me LOL! Plus it will cut costs and ensure everyone who is definitely coming to get their deposit down on the hotel early so my fiance and I can budget accordingly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913307,"PostDate":1462348072,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am considering doing a Save the Date\/wedding invite all together with loads of information. We plan on keeping to wedding pretty small so sending out Save the Dates and having everyone book their hotel and flights early and then sending out formal invites a few months prior to the wedding just doesn't make sense to me LOL! Plus it will cut costs and ensure everyone who is definitely coming to get their deposit down on the hotel early so my fiance and I can budget accordingly.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sashlozada@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.192.76.178","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1462346009,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286871.jpg?_r=1462360488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sashloz","Id":286871,"Name":"sashloz","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80035","Title":"Do I Need A Save The Date?","LastPostDate":1462348072},"Pages":{"TotalItems":7,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":2,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
