{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":25,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":2068,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1723339,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":225447,"Name":"Traci7642","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225447.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1361362010,"LastPoster":{"Id":285438,"Name":"jonesharry","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285438.png?_r=1456302282","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":34,"Preview":{"Id":1723339,"PostDate":1361362010,"PostContent":"I've received such great feedback from my guests, that I thought I would share our STD. \u00a0We had...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tdemoss6@aim.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1265670916,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225447.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Traci7642","Id":225447,"Name":"Traci7642","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72690,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b7fd0574347e165e9dc80d46704e899d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;ve received such great feedback from my guests, that I thought I would share our STD. &amp;nbsp;We had every intention of doing a luggage tag STD but after some discussions we decided to shift directions. &amp;nbsp;We would always say \"if people could just see how awesome this place is, they&#039;d go\" so we figured there would be no better way than to send a DVD STD. &amp;nbsp;We created it in iMovie and it turned out so well. &amp;nbsp;We started the DVD with a short video from my fiance and I explaining what they&#039;d find on the DVD. &amp;nbsp;We then followed that by a great video we found on YouTube about our resort and then followed that by all of our travel agent\/pricing information. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We have had two families contact us and say that they had no intention of going, but that after watching the DVD there is no way they can resist. &amp;nbsp;I think it really paid off and would encourage everyone to think about it!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We also decided to make DIY sleeves to make it a little more festive than a standard jewel case.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361374365901_13773\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"189329\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189329\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We bought a really nice textured scrapbooking paper from Hobby Lobby and used a template that I found off the internet to make the CD sleeve.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"189330\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189330\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"189331\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189331\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We then cut the slats to carry the ribbon through.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361374365901_30539\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"189332\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189332\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We then used a glue gun to attach the ribbon to the inside and to glue the CD sleeve closed. &amp;nbsp;The stickers we ordered from Zazzle with our monogram was the last addition.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361374365901_37327\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"189333\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189333\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The last step we did was to purchase envelopes and shipping labels from Staples so that we could get them mailed off. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361374365901_44124\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"189334\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189334\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Here is a price breakdown for our STD. &amp;nbsp;We made and shipped 72 STDs.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Sticker w\/ monogram (from zazzle.com) - $22.09&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; DVDs 100 - $34.99&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Blue Paper (Hobby Lobby - 40 sheets that we cut in half) - $13.50&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Red Ribbon (Hobby Lobby) - $16.00&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Envelopes (Staples) - $15.79&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Shipping Labels (Staples) - $8.49&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Postage ($0.86 each due to non-machinable CD - yikes!) - $60.26&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Grand Total for 72 STDs = $171.12&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1723339,"PostDate":1361362010,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I've received such great feedback from my guests, that I thought I would share our STD. \u00a0We had every intention of doing a luggage tag STD but after some discussions we decided to shift directions. \u00a0We would always say \"if people could just see how awesome this place is, they'd go\" so we figured there would be no better way than to send a DVD STD. \u00a0We created it in iMovie and it turned out so well. \u00a0We started the DVD with a short video from my fiance and I explaining what they'd find on the DVD. \u00a0We then followed that by a great video we found on YouTube about our resort and then followed that by all of our travel agent\/pricing information. \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We have had two families contact us and say that they had no intention of going, but that after watching the DVD there is no way they can resist. \u00a0I think it really paid off and would encourage everyone to think about it!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We also decided to make DIY sleeves to make it a little more festive than a standard jewel case.<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361374365901_13773\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189329\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"189329\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189329\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We bought a really nice textured scrapbooking paper from Hobby Lobby and used a template that I found off the internet to make the CD sleeve.<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189330\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"189330\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189330\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189331\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"189331\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189331\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We then cut the slats to carry the ribbon through.<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361374365901_30539\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189332\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"189332\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189332\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We then used a glue gun to attach the ribbon to the inside and to glue the CD sleeve closed. \u00a0The stickers we ordered from Zazzle with our monogram was the last addition.<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361374365901_37327\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189333\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"189333\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189333\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The last step we did was to purchase envelopes and shipping labels from Staples so that we could get them mailed off. \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361374365901_44124\"> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189334\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"189334\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/189334\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here is a price breakdown for our STD. \u00a0We made and shipped 72 STDs.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Sticker w\/ monogram (from zazzle.com) - $22.09<\/p> <p> DVDs 100 - $34.99<\/p> <p> Blue Paper (Hobby Lobby - 40 sheets that we cut in half) - $13.50<\/p> <p> Red Ribbon (Hobby Lobby) - $16.00<\/p> <p> Envelopes (Staples) - $15.79<\/p> <p> Shipping Labels (Staples) - $8.49<\/p> <p> Postage ($0.86 each due to non-machinable CD - yikes!) - $60.26<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Grand Total for 72 STDs = $171.12<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tdemoss6@aim.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1265670916,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225447.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Traci7642","Id":225447,"Name":"Traci7642","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72690,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ae66425d8de945ee13050ba296b051b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; That is so amazing!!!!! I love it! What a fun, fun, fun idea :D&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Yikes, if only the postage hadn&#039;t cost so much, it&#039;s actually fairly inexpensive!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Very impressed. &lt;span alt=\":eclipsee_gold_cup:\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361377207796_1569\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/eclipsee_gold_cup.gif\"&gt;&lt;img id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361377207796_1571\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/eclipsee_gold_cup.gif\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1723357,"PostDate":1361363034,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> That is so amazing!!!!! I love it! What a fun, fun, fun idea <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Yikes, if only the postage hadn't cost so much, it's actually fairly inexpensive!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Very impressed. <span alt=\":eclipsee_gold_cup:\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361377207796_1569\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/eclipsee_gold_cup.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1361377207796_1571\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/eclipsee_gold_cup.gif\" \/><\/span><\/span><br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenny.mccallum@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.114.49.159","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1351073287,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261719.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jenny2014","Id":261719,"Name":"Jenny2014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72690,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7e51274d1ba60836d521c26d4afe6560","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks a bunch! &amp;nbsp;They really were inexpensive and really made a huge impact. &amp;nbsp;I think if we would&#039;ve just bought standard stamps and stuck them in the mail, they would&#039;ve been just fine and saved us quite a bit of money.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1723898,"PostDate":1361449019,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks a bunch! \u00a0They really were inexpensive and really made a huge impact. \u00a0I think if we would've just bought standard stamps and stuck them in the mail, they would've been just fine and saved us quite a bit of money.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tdemoss6@aim.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1265670916,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225447.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Traci7642","Id":225447,"Name":"Traci7642","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72690,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"82a4ae64f8608c5198762fe10f0c14ca","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; What a great idea!! They look fantastic!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1723911,"PostDate":1361449970,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helve