 lol... i meant 'ladies'<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tdemoss6@aim.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1265670916,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225447.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Traci7642","Id":225447,"Name":"Traci7642","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72690,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0edcf05e838cb038cf2c0bd0000a0f8c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; So you inspired me to go the video save the date route. How did you download a video from youtube? I didn&#039;t think you could do that. Also, would you mind sharing your video? I&#039;ve been looking at other save the dates and have nothing like what you have described. I am not the creative type so any help would be great!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; \n ~Norma&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1742283,"PostDate":1365105954,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> So you inspired me to go the video save the date route. How did you download a video from youtube? I didn't think you could do that. Also, would you mind sharing your video? I've been looking at other save the dates and have nothing like what you have described. I am not the creative type so any help would be great!<\/p> <p> <br \/> ~Norma<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"norm09@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"209.6.113.231","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1358955376,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264954.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"normas09","Id":264954,"Name":"normas09","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72690,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"683ef4b2697e2853db4f3bd9797ca5fd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Best idea ever! I wish I&#039;d seen this or thought of it! Do you have a copy of the video you put together?\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1742291,"PostDate":1365107496,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Best idea ever! I wish I'd seen this or thought of it! Do you have a copy of the video you put together?<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alexismmoore@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.231.22.147","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1337119161,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255437.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":667,"PhotoHeight":1000,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"alexisinjamaica","Id":255437,"Name":"alexisinjamaica","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72690,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a55769b31b177a3d0031a3b99033540c","RawContent":"I&#039;m so glad you like them!  They really were a big hit with our friends and family.  I tried to upload it, but the file size must be too large.  I can try sending them to your personal email addresses if you want to PM them to me.  \n \n As for downloading YouTube videos, here&#039;s a link to download w\/o installing any extra software [url=\"http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=Gt2SmMprL48\"]http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=Gt2SmMprL48[\/url] \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]normas09[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n So you inspired me to go the video save the date route. How did you download a video from youtube? I didn&#039;t think you could do that. Also, would you mind sharing your video? I&#039;ve been looking at other save the dates and have nothing like what you have described. I am not the creative type so any help would be great! \n \n ~Norma[\/quote] \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]alexisinjamaica[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Best idea ever! I wish I&#039;d seen this or thought of it! Do you have a copy of the video you put together?\n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1742483,"PostDate":1365167196,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm so glad you like them! \u00a0They really were a big hit with our friends and family. \u00a0I tried to upload it, but the file size must be too large. \u00a0I can try sending them to your personal email addresses if you want to PM them to me.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> As for downloading YouTube videos, here's a link to download w\/o installing any extra software\u00a0<iframe id=\"ytplayer\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" type=\"text\/html\" width=\"640\" height=\"390\" src=\"http:\/\/youtube.com\/embed\/Gt2SmMprL48?html5=1&fs=1\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen webkitallowfullscreen \/><\/iframe><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>normas09<\/strong>\u00a0<a href='\/t\/84978\/my-diy-save-the-date-dvd\/10#post_1891852' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/a><br \/> <br \/> <p> So you inspired me to go the video save the date route. How did you download a video from youtube? I didn't think you could do that. Also, would you mind sharing your video? I've been looking at other save the dates and have nothing like what you have described. I am not the creative type so any help would be great!<\/p> <p> <br \/> ~Norma<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>alexisinjamaica<\/strong>\u00a0<a href='\/t\/84978\/my-diy-save-the-date-dvd\/10#post_1891860' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/a><br \/> <br \/> <p> Best idea ever! I wish I'd seen this or thought of it! Do you have a copy of the video you put together?<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tdemoss6@aim.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1265670916,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225447.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Traci7642","Id":225447,"Name":"Traci7642","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72690,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"50f42244b79a6facbf169fb3bdf97e77","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; That would be amazing... I am going to pm you now with email.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1742573,"PostDate":1365181612,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> That would be amazing... I am going to pm you now with email.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"norm09@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"209.6.113.231","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1358955376,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264954.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"normas09","Id":264954,"Name":"normas09","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72690,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6470d8e4e365f4f5199e61c2e6a37959","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Okay ladies... I think I figured out how to upload our dvd to youtube. &amp;nbsp;here it is!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; http:\/\/youtu.be\/ubPoG5ZWfpA&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1742575,"PostDate":1365181654,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Okay ladies... I think I figured out how to upload our dvd to youtube. \u00a0here it is!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <iframe id=\"ytplayer\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" type=\"text\/html\" width=\"640\" height=\"390\" src=\"http:\/\/youtube.com\/embed\/ubPoG5ZWfpA?html5=1&fs=1\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen webkitallowfullscreen \/><\/iframe><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tdemoss6@aim.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1265670916,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225447.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Traci7642","Id":225447,"Name":"Traci7642","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72690,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fb304d13c58b192e1c93238604061c73","RawContent":"&lt;p&g